  "story": {
    "title": "Our Living Room",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "I am Rina. This is my brother Sonu. We love each other.",
      "We play together in our living room.",
      "We have a bookshelf in our living room. My father keeps many books in the bookshelf.",
      "I read one story everyday.",
      "I am very neat.",
      "But my brother is very messy. He throws his toys, books, shoes and pens on the floor.",
      "We have a sofa in our living room. My parents like to sit on the sofa. We also have a carpet in our living room. The carpet is on the floor. I like to sit on the carpet.",
      "My brother and I help our mother in cleaning the house. I sweep the floor. My brother cleans the bookshelf. We love our home a lot."
    ],
    "sentences": [
